        "name": "Hanamura Temple"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Diablo does great on Maps where the early game is not that important (such as Garden of Terror) and where findining opportunities to use Shadow Charge near impassable terrain is easy, resulting into a Stun and thus extra damage.\n\nDiablo does poorly on Maps with wide areas, where he cannot get value from impassable terrain, and on Maps where the early game is important (notably Braxis Holdout) because he is too weak before Level 7 and without Souls for Black Soulstone."
  },
